# SQLite datastore (§14.3) -- unlike the users.json/climbs.json files it
# replaces, this is a binary file that changes on every mutation, so it's
# not tracked in git the way those were (§14.1 remains open/deferred on
# whether that should also apply retroactively to the JSON files still in
# the repo). Needs its own backup story outside git -- see the "Running it
# persistently" section of README.md.
